sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main
    participant Codec as QRCodec
    participant TE as TextEncoder
    participant FP as FinderPattern
    participant ZZ as ZigZag
    participant MV as MatrixValidator
    participant Det as QRDetector
    participant Ren as QRRenderer
    Main->>Codec: encode("hello-世界")
    Codec->>MV: ensureValidSize(21)
    Codec->>TE: encodePayload(text)
    Codec->>FP: reservedMask(size)
    Codec->>ZZ: traversal(size,reserved)
    Codec->>FP: place(matrix)
    Codec-->>Main: QRMatrix
    Main->>Ren: render(matrix)
    Ren-->>Main: String (one line per row)
    Main->>Codec: decode(matrix)
    Codec->>FP: verify(matrix)
    Codec->>Det: extractPayloadBytes(matrix)
    Det->>Det: readDataBits(matrix)
    Det->>TE: bitsToBytes(bits)
    Det->>TE: decodePayload(frame)
    Codec-->>Main: String
    Main-->>Main: print concise result; return